# Project plan

`PLAN.md` in the project root holds the steps of this project and their status.

- Read `PLAN.md` at the start of a conversation, before doing project work.
- When a step finishes, update its status and the "Current step / Next step" line in `PLAN.md`,
  then tell the user which step was finished and which step comes next.
- When the user decides something that changes the plan (scope, budget, settings), record it
  under "Decisions made". Record new measurements (shop counts, costs) under "Measured so far".
- The user is a business owner, not a developer. Write in plain, simple English, give exact
  commands to run, and state the cost before any paid Apify run.
